          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kara giketh ceng’ maeni mi Purim ucung i nindone ma juketho, calku ma Mordekai ma Jayahudi ku Ester ma ci ubimo ng’olo igi, man calu ging’olo igi gigi man pi nyikwaigi, i lembe mi wekocemo man ywak migi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.31",
